	"data": "Cover Letter Christopher DiCarlo BDS\n\nJuly 23, 2020\nBDS\nPortland, OR\nRe: Mobile Game Developer\nDear Hiring Manager,\nI am applying for the position of Mobile Game Developer.\nI am very interested in this position. I believe I am a solid fit for this work, including experience with Unity, C#, Git, and Virtual Reality.\nI have been studying and developing programs with Unity and C# for the last couple of years and have a high degree of knowledge and interest in VR development. I am very comfortable…",
